recipe_information = "[item]Deluxe_chirashi_bowl[/item]s are made with [item]sliced_salmon[/item], [item]sliced_tuna[/item], [item]shrimp[/item], [item]sliced_cucumber[/item], [item]tamago[/item] from a [machine]frying_pan[/machine], [item]nori_bundle[/item] (seaweed), and [item]cooked_rice[/item] from a [machine]rice_cooker[/machine]. Chirashi bowls are traditional Japanese rice bowls topped with ingredients typically found in sushi; they're essentially deconstructed sushi."
